Public embed author metadata
---------------------------
The public syndication endpoint and embed token calculation in src/core.js
follow Vercel react-tweet's fetch-tweet.ts:
https://github.com/vercel/react-tweet/blob/main/packages/react-tweet/src/api/fetch-tweet.ts
Only metadata for an already independently verified public post is used.

